# What must never enter a Railway build context.
#
# `railway up` uploads this directory. .gitignore already covers most of it,
# but the cost of being wrong here is a secret leaving the machine, so the
# exclusions that matter are repeated explicitly rather than inherited.

# Local secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# Host-built output. node_modules holds macOS-native binaries that would be
# wrong inside a Linux image; each service's build installs its own.
node_modules
.next
out
coverage
dist

# History and local tooling.
.git
.github
.claude

# Generated brand assets are already committed into the image contexts that
# need them; the masters and the contact sheet are not needed to build.
branding/generated/preview
